    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a fresh take on the classic Bubble Shooter Genre with Bubbits! <strong>Wishlist now</strong> and join the bubble-popping revolution today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/4bf2ee2d0d5a7a71f3a64be69060cb16.poster.avif?t=1751731432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/4bf2ee2d0d5a7a71f3a64be69060cb16.webm?t=1751731432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in massive 25-Player online Battle Royale matches or go head-to-head with friends in the intense 2-4 player VS Mode. Take on the world in the Daily Challenge, or embrace the timeless Classic Bubble Shooter experience in Solo Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/1246df94ac2e766af7020285fc64db7c.poster.avif?t=1751731432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/1246df94ac2e766af7020285fc64db7c.webm?t=1751731432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun Power Ups &amp; Crazy Battle Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash game-changing powerups and adapt to dynamic Battle Events that change up the game. Climb the ranks to showcase your bubble-popping mastery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/bb0bba5ec3434d306b875ba86697ea7b.poster.avif?t=1751731432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/bb0bba5ec3434d306b875ba86697ea7b.webm?t=1751731432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/54c15e9c58ed2f30f14d3684d5368340.poster.avif?t=1751731432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/54c15e9c58ed2f30f14d3684d5368340.webm?t=1751731432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization - Pop the competition in style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're casually playing or in the Final of a Bubbits Royale, bring your personal flair and make every victory your own. Customize your Bubbits experience with unique characters, adjust the look of your playfield, and bring your groove if you make it to the Royale Final. Enjoy lag-free online battles on dedicated servers, where your skills and quick reflexes truly decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Bubbits to your wishlist and prepare for the bubble battle of a lifetime! Whether you're here for the massive multiplayer mayhem or the solo experience, Bubbits delivers non-stop action that's easy to pick up but impossible to put down!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a fresh take on the classic Bubble Shooter Genre with Bubbits! <strong>Wishlist now</strong> and join the bubble-popping revolution today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/4bf2ee2d0d5a7a71f3a64be69060cb16.poster.avif?t=1751731432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/4bf2ee2d0d5a7a71f3a64be69060cb16.webm?t=1751731432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in massive 25-Player online Battle Royale matches or go head-to-head with friends in the intense 2-4 player VS Mode. Take on the world in the Daily Challenge, or embrace the timeless Classic Bubble Shooter experience in Solo Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/1246df94ac2e766af7020285fc64db7c.poster.avif?t=1751731432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/1246df94ac2e766af7020285fc64db7c.webm?t=1751731432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun Power Ups &amp; Crazy Battle Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash game-changing powerups and adapt to dynamic Battle Events that change up the game. Climb the ranks to showcase your bubble-popping mastery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/bb0bba5ec3434d306b875ba86697ea7b.poster.avif?t=1751731432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/bb0bba5ec3434d306b875ba86697ea7b.webm?t=1751731432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/54c15e9c58ed2f30f14d3684d5368340.poster.avif?t=1751731432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483270/extras/54c15e9c58ed2f30f14d3684d5368340.webm?t=1751731432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization - Pop the competition in style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're casually playing or in the Final of a Bubbits Royale, bring your personal flair and make every victory your own. Customize your Bubbits experience with unique characters, adjust the look of your playfield, and bring your groove if you make it to the Royale Final. Enjoy lag-free online battles on dedicated servers, where your skills and quick reflexes truly decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Bubbits to your wishlist and prepare for the bubble battle of a lifetime! Whether you're here for the massive multiplayer mayhem or the solo experience, Bubbits delivers non-stop action that's easy to pick up but impossible to put down!</p>",
    "short_description": "Pop your way to victory in a colorful next generation Bubble Shooter. Perfect for casual and competitive players alike! Compete in a 25 Player Battle Royale, Play VS with friends or go Solo. Customize your Playfield, unleash Power Ups and experience crazy battle events that shake up the game!",
